{"id":"648482","name":"凉拌海带金针菇","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/648482/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"海带","amount":"适量"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"半截"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"2根"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"泡发好的海带，香菜切段。","img":"images/648482/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"金针菇，胡萝卜丝。","img":"images/648482/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱末，蒜末。","img":"images/648482/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"浇入热油。","img":"images/648482/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入辣椒酱（家里吃的辣椒酱都可以）酱油、陈醋、糖、味精、香油，调拌均匀。","img":"images/648482/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"水开后放点油和盐，放入海带焯熟。","img":"images/648482/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入金针菇和胡萝卜丝，焯水2分钟。","img":"images/648482/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出。","img":"images/648482/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/648482/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入调好的酱汁和香菜，拌匀即可。","img":"images/648482/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。好吃又掉秤，安排起来！","img":"images/648482/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}